<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2PE" style="id">- Matumbi Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">2 PETILI</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Pet</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Petili</para>
  <para style="toc1">Balua Yenebi'li' ya Petili</para>
  <para style="mt1">2 Petili</para>
  <para style="mt2">Balua Yenebi'li' ya Petili</para>
  <para style="imt">Kilongolyo</para>
  <para style="ip">Balua ya 2 Petili yaandikilwe na Ntumilwe Pauli. Iwesa panga mundu ywi'ngi' aandike paali pake. Mwandiki abaya panga ywembe aabile mundu ywaagabweni maisa ga Yesu kwa minyo na muno si'lu' kyendo sa Yesu bonekana muutukupu abile pamope na Musa na Elia (1:17). Manaitei Petili ngaywaandike balua yi', bai ilaya aandike abile Roma mumyaka ya 60 bu'ka po belekwa Yesu Kilisitu, kiwo sake kibile balo. Kai' Petili aikema yi' panga balua yake yenebi'li' (3:1) na kuubi'ka mwaka waandike balua yi' bu'ka pa yi'lu' ya 1 Petili. Aiandike balua yi' kwa Akilisitu boti.</para>
  <para style="ip">Petili aandike balua yi' kwa kitumbu sa kwayi'ya mwoyo aumini babatama mumaisa ga kunkilikitya Nnu'ngu' na kwakwi'li'ka kanebaaki'ngame balimu ba ubu'su' (2). Aasopite bandu baasalawe bababile kababaya panga Yesu asi'liye buya. Paali pake alayite panga Nnu'ngu' asi'yali, lakini apala bandu boti bakosopolelwe (3:8). Si'no nga kitumbu so tama maisa manogau gagannogelelya Nnu'ngu' (3:14).</para>
  <para style="iot">Mutasali</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Petili aiawanikia mwene na kwatambwa asomi bake baali'ngite <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2PE 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref>)</char>.</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Aku'mbu'ki'ya tama maisa manogau kwa kitumbu sa Nnu'ngu' atupei uweso wo tama nyo <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2PE 1:3-21">1:3-21</ref>)</char>.</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Akwi'li'ka kwa balimu ba ubu'su' na baya nga kili'be saku' sasaalu'a kwapitya balimu ba ubu'su' kuundi'la <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2PE 2:1-22">2:1-22</ref>)</char>.</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Petili ayomolya kwakong'ondelya aumini batame maisa manogau kabaibi'ka wiso kwo isa kwa Yesu Kilisitu kwa mala yenebi'li' <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2PE 3:1-17">3:1-17</ref>)</char>.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2PE 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 1:1" />Nenga na Simoni Petili, ntumisi na ntumilwe wa Yesu Kilisitu, nimwandikyanga mwenga, mwamupatike imani ya samani ngu'lu' kati yitu kwa ndi'la ya aki ya Yesu Kilisitu ywembe nga Nnu'ngu' na Nkosopoli witu.<verse eid="2PE 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 1:2" />Ninnu'bya ngu'ngu' na amani yambone kwa ndi'la ya kuntanga Nnu'ngu' na Yesu Bwana witu.<verse eid="2PE 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mutikemelwa no saulilwa na Nnu'ngu'</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 1:3" />Nnu'ngu' kwa uweso wake, atupei makowe goti gatugapala, li'nga tube na ukoti no tama mumaisa ga kunnyu'wa Nnu'ngu', kwa kuntanga ywembe ywatukemite kwa utukupu wake na unogau wake mwene. <verse eid="2PE 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 1:4" />Kwo pi'tya go, atuyalile upo ngu'lu' na ya ngama muno yaatulagile, li'nga kwa upo yo, mupate yepa ulau waubile padunia, waubu'kana na maminyikio manyatau no panga kiselele muube wa Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="2PE 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 1:5" />Kwa kitumbu so, mukasane muno yongeya unogau muimani yinu, na muunogau winu muyongeye ilimu, <verse eid="2PE 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 1:6" />na muilimu yinu muli'ngi'li, no li'ngi'lya kwo komeya, komeya kwinu panga mwapala Nnu'ngu', <verse eid="2PE 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 1:7" />na mwapala Nnu'ngu' panga kwa upendano wa kinolongo, na muupendano wa kinolongo, upendo wa Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="2PE 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 1:8" />Kwa mwanjaa aga goti mana gabile nkati yinu no yendelya ku'la, gaalu'a wesa kumpanga mubeleye itunda inannoga yainnaya mwenga kuntanga Bwana witu Yesu Kilisitu. <verse eid="2PE 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 1:9" />Lakini mundu ywangali baa na makowe kati ga, aywo nga mbulibuli na alibalile panga aayomwike peleteyelwa sambi yake ya kwai'mbu'.<verse eid="2PE 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 1:10" />Bai, mwaalongo bangu', mukasane muno kuukong'ondelya mkemo winu no saulilwa kwinu na Nnu'ngu'. Mana mwaatama nyo, katu mwaaku'balali, <verse eid="2PE 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 1:11" />ila, mwaalu'a yi'ki'ti'lwa peyelwa aki yaitimilike yo yingya muukulungwa wa milele wa Bwana na Nkosopoli witu Yesu Kilisitu.<verse eid="2PE 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 1:12" />Kwa nyo naalu'a yendelya kunku'mbu'ki'ya makowe ga masu'ba goti, pamope no panga mugatangite na mukangamile muukakape wamuupokile. <verse eid="2PE 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 1:13" />Niibona panga, inogeleli nsimu woti panibaa pano padunia, nipalikwa kunku'mbu'ki'ya bu'kana na makowe ga. <verse eid="2PE 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 1:14" />Nibaya nya kwa mwanjaa nitangite Bwana witu Yesu Kilisitu aatiniumukulya panga, naalu'a bu'ka pano padunia, na nenga nibona nsimu wo wegelile. <verse eid="2PE 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 1:15" />Bai, nilu'a binia panga nyo kwo kasana, li'nga bu'ka pakiwo sangu' mwaawese kugaku'mbu'kya makowe ga.<verse eid="2PE 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Twaubweni utukupu wa Kilisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 1:16" />Patunnyi'ganage bu'kana na uweso wo isa kwake, Bwana witu Yesu Kilisitu, twaau'bi'li lili ngongo ya kwai'mbu', yayaandikilwe kwa ung'anga, ila twaubweni utukupu wake kwa minyo gitu. <verse eid="2PE 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 1:17" />Mwanjaa aapatike isima na utukupu bu'ka kwa Tati' Nnu'ngu', apo palimwisilile lilobe bu'ka kwake ywembe ywabile Ntukupu Nku'lu' kalibaya, “Ayu' nga mwana wangu' ywanimpendile, ywaninogelile.” <verse eid="2PE 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 1:18" />Kai', twenga twabene twaaliyu'wine lilobe lyo, bu'ka kunani, patwaabile pamope nakwe panani ya si'lu' kitu'mbi' kipeleteu.<verse eid="2PE 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 1:19" />Na twenga tubile nalyo li'lu' liyi'gi'yo lya kilondoli lyalikangamile pi'ta, mana mulilingulile kati kimulikyo sakimulika pandu poti palubi'ndu', mpaka lisu'ba li'lu' palyalu'a saa na bweya wa lutondwa lwa kindai' palwaalu'a ng'alang'atya mumyoyo yinu. <verse eid="2PE 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 1:20" />Lakini bu'ka pa ago goti muku'mbu'ki panga ntu'pu' ulondoli wa Maandiko Mapeleteu wa kwapanga alondoli baawanikiye bu'kana na mwabawasa bene. <verse eid="2PE 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 1:21" />Mwanjaa ntu'pu' liyi'gi'yo lya kilondoli lyalibu'kana na mwapala mundu. Ila bandu babalondwa balongoyelwa na Loo Mpeleteu.<verse eid="2PE 1:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2PE 2" />
  <para style="s">Balimu ba ubu'su'</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 2:1" />Paapitike alondoli ba ubu'su' nkati ya bandu, nyinyonyo na balimu ba ubu'su' baalu'a pitya nkati yinu. Baalu'a yingiya mayi'gano gagaobeya ukakape na kunkana Bwana ywaakosopolile. Kwa ndi'la yo yaapanga kitumbu so langamiswa kwabe kiyu'ngu'ya. <verse eid="2PE 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 2:2" />Na bandu baingi baalu'a kwikota ndi'la yabe ndau, na kwa kitumbu sa abo, baingi baalu'a salawa ndi'la ya kakape ya Bwana. <verse eid="2PE 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 2:3" />Kwa maminyikio gabe manyatau baalu'a kummakia ngongo ya ubu'su' li'nga bapate si'lu' sabapala bu'ka kwinu. Lakini bu'ka kwai'mbu', ukumu yabe ibi'kilwe wiso no langamiswa kwabe kwegelile.<verse eid="2PE 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 2:4" />Malaika pabaapangite sambi, Nnu'ngu' aabi'kili kiya, ila aataikuli kumambi' akwo baatama muutabilwe wa lubi'ndu' mpaka yaaise ukumu. <verse eid="2PE 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 2:5" />Nnu'ngu' aaibi'kili kiya dunia ya kwai'mbu' palu' paaletike nkukulo bu'kana na bandu balu' bangali kunkilikitya Nnu'ngu', lakini yu'lu' Nuu ywaai nkong'ondeli wa aki, aatikosopolelwa, pamope na bandu bi'ngi' saba. <verse eid="2PE 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 2:6" />Nyinyonyo Nnu'ngu' aipwatile mili'ma ya Sodoma na Gomola, ngailangamisa kwa mwoto no baa ligu. Apo alayage mpwano wa makowe gagaalu'a pitya kwa bandu alau. <verse eid="2PE 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 2:7" />Nnu'ngu' ngankosopolya Lutu, mundu mwene aki, ywaausunike muno bu'kana na nnyendo wabe nnyatau wa abo bandu alau. <verse eid="2PE 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 2:8" />Mundu ywo mwene aki aabile katama pakati yabe kwa masu'ba maingi, mpaka aati'kwanike mwoyo muno kwa kitumbu sa nnyendo wabe nnyatau waauyu'wine na kuubona. <verse eid="2PE 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 2:9" />Kwa nyo, Bwana Nnu'ngu' atangite bu'kana na kwakosopolya bandu babannyu'wa bu'ka mumapayilwo. Kai' atangite mbwatyo yabaapata apanga sambi lisu'ba li'lu' lya ukumu, <verse eid="2PE 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 2:10" />muno balu' bababi'ngi'ya maminyikio manyatau ga yi'ga no salawa amuli ya Nnu'ngu'.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 2:10">Balimu bo ba ubu'su' babile na kipi'li' so tauka na kwipuna, wala bayogopa lili kwitukana yumbe itukupu ya kunani. <verse eid="2PE 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 2:11" />Pamope no panga malaika babile na makakala muno, lakini basitakyali, wala kwitukana yumbe yo nnu'ngi' ya Bwana Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="2PE 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 2:12" />Bandu bo babatukana sangalikitanga, nga kati inyama yangali malango, bo boyolwa no sinjilwa! Na abo baalu'a langamiswa kati inyama. <verse eid="2PE 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 2:13" />Na baalu'a li'pi'lwa mateso kati galu' gabaapangile bandu bi'ngi'. Bapulaikya panga makowe maakau pabandu. Ata pabalya pamope na mwenga mumakalamu ginu, bapulaika kunkonga. Kwa ndi'la yo bembe babile kati malembele mungu'bo uu. <verse eid="2PE 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 2:14" />Minyo gabe gatwi'li upege, katu balekali panga sambi. Bandu bene imani yangakomala, basopelwa bapange malau gabe. Baiyobelike myoyo yabe minyikia mali, bandu bo bakosite lasi! <verse eid="2PE 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 2:15" />Ngabaileka ndi'la yaisu'mbu'lwike, ngabaoba no kota ndi'la yaikotike Balaamu mwana wa Boeri, ywaapendile pata pwaila kwo panga malau, <verse eid="2PE 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 2:16" />lakini aakalipilwe kwa kitumbu sa ulau wake. Mbu'nda nga kinyama lakini aalongei kwa lilobe lya mundu, li'nga kumwibya nnondoli ywo akotoke panga makowe ga kililalu'. <figure style="fig" alt="Balaam on donkey - CO00867" file="BalaamOnDonkey_Num22.21-30_CO00867.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by David C. Cook © David C. Cook Publishing Co., 1978." ref="2:16" /><verse eid="2PE 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 2:17" />Bandu ba nga kati kinywanyu sakiyu'mike, na nga kati maunde ga ula gagaku'ngu'lu'ka na limbu'nga pangali nia, potamo wabe pabi'kilwe wiso palubi'ndu' luku'lu'. <verse eid="2PE 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 2:18" />Kwo longela mayi'gano ga kwipuna na gangali ngama, no tumya maminyikiyo gabe malau ga kiyi'ga, baapi'ndi'ka balu' bababile kuutalu na balu' babatama muukongi. <verse eid="2PE 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 2:19" />Balimu bo baakong'ondelya ayabe uulu, kumbe bene nga abanda ba sambi, mwanjaa mundu apanga mmanda kwa kili'be si'lu' sakintawala. <verse eid="2PE 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 2:20" />Mana bautilike ulau wa dunia kwa kuntanga Bwana na Nkosopoli witu Yesu Kilisitu, bu'kapo ngabakola kai' na ulau wo no sindwa, ali yabe yaalu'a panga inannyata muno kulikoni ya palongoi. <verse eid="2PE 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 2:21" />Nantali yabe bakakotoka kwitanga kabisa ndi'la ya aki, kulikoni kwitanga bu'kapo kwileka yi'lu' amuli mbeleteu yabapokile. <verse eid="2PE 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2PE 2:22" />Ibile ngongo yaibaya, <char style="qt">“Mbwa agaki'li'bu'ki matapi gake mwene,”</char> na yi'ngi' ibaya, “Ngu'be ywagu'lu'li'lwe agalabwike kai' mumatope!” Nga mwaibile kwabe nambi'yambi'.<verse eid="2PE 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2PE 3" />
  <para style="s">Lisu'ba lya Bwana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 3:1" />Mwaapendwa bangu', yi'no nga balua yangu' yenebi'li' yanimwandikyanga, mubalua yoti yi' nipaya yumuya mabinio ginu manogau li'nga mupate ku'mbu'kya makowe ga. <verse eid="2PE 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 3:2" />Nipala mwenga muku'mbu'ki mayi'gi'yo gagabayilwe kwai'mbu' na alondoli apeleteu ba Nnu'ngu', na yi'lu' amuli ya Bwana na Nkosopoli yamupeyilwe pi'tya kwa atumilwe. <verse eid="2PE 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 3:3" />Wi'ti' mupalikwa tanga panga, masu'ba ga kuundi'la baalu'a pitya bandu bene misalango, babakota maminyikio gabe maakau, <verse eid="2PE 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 3:4" />kababaya panga, “Yesu aalagi isa! Tumbwelelo ai kwaku'? Bu'ka au'ku' bitu pabawile, makowe goti gabile nyanyalu'nyalu' kati mwagaabile bu'ka umbilwa kwa dunia!” <verse eid="2PE 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 3:5" />Lakini bembe kwa lipu'njo balibalya panga Nnu'ngu' aaumbike kunani na dunia kwa liyi'gi'yo. Dunia yaaumbilwe bu'ka mumasi' na kwa ndi'la ya masi'. <verse eid="2PE 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 3:6" />Nyinyonyo kwo bu'kana na nkukulo wa dunia ya nsimu wu'lu' yaatilangamiswa. <verse eid="2PE 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 3:7" />Lakini kwa liyi'gi'yo lyolyo Nnu'ngu' abi'kite kunani na dunia yi'no ya nambi'yambi', li'nga aialabiye kwa mwoto. Abi'kite wiso kwa kitumbu sa lisu'ba li'lu' lyo ukumu bandu bangali kunkilikitya Nnu'ngu', apo ngapabaalangamiswa.<verse eid="2PE 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 3:8" />Lakini mwaapendwa bangu', kanemulibali likowe limo li' panga nnu'ngi' ya Bwana Nnu'ngu', lisu'ba limo nga kati myaka elupu yimo, na myaka elupu kwake ywembe nga kati lisu'ba limo bai. <verse eid="2PE 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 3:9" />Bwana asi'yali kulitimilisa lilagano lyake kati bandu bi'ngi' mwabagania panga aalu'a si'ya. Paali pake, ywembe endakunkomeyanga kwa mwanjaa akani mundu ywoywoti alangamiswe, ila kila mundu anng'alambuki ywembe.<verse eid="2PE 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 3:10" />Lakini lisu'ba lyo buya Bwana lyaalu'a isa kati mwii. Apo kunani kwabu'ki'ka kwa mwago nku'lu', na kila kili'be sa kibelekwe satiniyilwa na dunia pamope na kila kili'be sakibile mo saumukulwa na Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="2PE 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 3:11" />Kwa mwanjaa kila kili'be saalabiyilwa kubi nnya, buli mwenga mupalikwa baa mwabandu gani? Mupalikwa tama maisa mapeleteu ga kunnyu'wa Nnu'ngu', <verse eid="2PE 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 3:12" />kamuli'nda no imilisa isa kwa lisu'ba lyo lya Nnu'ngu'. Lisu'ba lyo lyaleta kunani sonjelwa mwoto no bu'yi'lwa na ili'be ya kibelekwe yalembuka. <verse eid="2PE 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 3:13" />Lakini bu'kana na lilagano lyake, twenga tupi'kanilya kunani kwaayambi' na dunia yaayambi', yalu' yaitama aki nkati yake.<verse eid="2PE 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 3:14" />Kwa nyo mwaapendwa bangu', kwa mwanjaa mupi'kanilya go, mukasane li'nga mube na mwoyo mpeleteu, pangali laumilwa no baa na amani nnu'ngi' ya Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="2PE 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 3:15" />Mutange panga Bwana witu aakomeya bandu li'nga bapate lipala lyo kosopolelwa, kati mwaamwandikile mpendwa witu Pauli, kwa ikima yaapeyilwe na Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="2PE 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 3:16" />Mubalua yake yoti aalongeli makowe go, gabile makowe gambone na gaganonwipe kugatanga. Makowe go bandu alalo na bangali komala muimani, bendagaobeya, kati mu'lu' mwabagaobeya Maandiko Mapeleteu gi'ngi'. Kwa nyo baipalya bene kitumbu so langamiswa.<verse eid="2PE 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 3:17" />Mwaapendwa bangu', nambi'yambi' mutangite makowe ga, kwa nyo mwili'ndi'le li'nga mwaakane kongelwa na makosa ga bandu alau, no tu'mbu'ka bu'ka muimani yinu yaikomile. <verse eid="2PE 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 3:18" />Ila muyendeli ku'la mungu'ngu' ya kuntanga Bwana na Nkosopoli witu Yesu Kilisitu. Utukupu ubile kwa ywembe nambi'yambi' ata milele! Amina.<verse eid="2PE 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 3" />
</usx>